{"id":"9ffb6ae6f4ef2728","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Preservation Of Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Preservation Of Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Preservation Of Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-generic]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-df-generic-extension]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-bijective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal — ZFC Forcing12 Preservation Of Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"58-df-generic-extension\">58-df-generic-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M\">\\(P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\)</span> are the exact upstream predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> are the sourced ordinal and bijection predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\)</span> (internal-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}internal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}internal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}of\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land\\forall G,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G))\\to\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,N)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}of\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land\\forall G,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G))\\to\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,N)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cardinal preservation is relative to an explicit theory, ground model, ordered poset, generic filter, and registered generic extension.</li>\n<li>Internal cardinality is expanded as the absence, inside the relevant transitive model, of a set-coded bijection with a smaller ordinal; no unbound satisfaction notation or implicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span> object remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-extension","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bijective]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}internal\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\leftrightarrow\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\kappa,\\alpha)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}preservation\\text{-}of\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,M)\\land\\forall G,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G))\\to\\mathrm{ForcingInternalCardinal}_S(\\kappa,N)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false}],"bytes":2173,"backlinks":[{"id":"9fc0a120866a80f6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f3ed0badfcd1f292","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2051","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-forcing12-pr